{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to .firebaserc and replace the placeholders once the Firebase projects exist.",
    ".firebaserc is git-ignored so that a developer's local project aliases are never",
    "committed, and so this repo never claims ownership of a project that has not been",
    "created yet. No Firebase projects exist as of Phase 1.",
    "",
    "Emulator work does NOT need this file: the npm scripts pass --project=eattables-local."
  ],
  "projects": {
    "dev": "REPLACE_WITH_DEV_PROJECT_ID",
    "prod": "REPLACE_WITH_PROD_PROJECT_ID"
  }
}
